  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infraestructura Vial Productiva II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Infraestructura Vial Productiva II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Los objetivos principales son: fortalecer las redes viales provinciales, vincular reas productivas locales con la red nacional para facilitar el acceso a los centros de consumo, favorecer el intercambio regional, apuntalar el crecimiento econmico, consolidar la reactivacin del sector productivo, contribuir a resolver los problemas de pobreza y desempleo, y fortalecer las instituciones provinciales encargadas del sistema vial.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objectives of the Program include: strengthening the provincial productive road networks, connect local production areas with the national highway network in order to improve access to consumer centers, improve regional interchange, support economic growth, consolidate the reactivation of the productive sector, contribute to reduce poverty and unemployment and strengthen the regional institutions in charge of the road sector.</narrative>
  </description>
